OL,3,GNEWSAResidents report Bayeux Tapestry
OL,4,Aticket issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British Museum spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"All residents are still able to book
OL,8,Ftickets as part of the general sale on
OL,9,Fthe 21 October."
